    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77dba6187529ea3d",
      "translationZh": "各位，我解决了一堆问题，成功降低了 Qwen 在流式语音通话中的延迟，使其与 deepgram 相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0ff4eab048fcead",
      "translationZh": "由于 Qwen 更像是一个基于音频 LLM 的 ASR 模型，它具备 ASR 所需的智能，能够知道你说的是电话号码、电子邮件地址等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41a305dad7da0e9a",
      "translationZh": "Qwen 在所有基准测试中的 WER 和多语言准确率方面都已经击败了 deepgram。但它实在太慢了，因此一直没有得到应有的关注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a61bfdda92268c79",
      "translationZh": "去 autoloops.ai 看看演示，服务托管在 us-west-2。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e2c7838911b7277",
      "translationZh": "如果你想进一步了解它是如何变得这么快的，请告诉我。我没有修改权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "833090684cce663a",
      "translationZh": "服务提供商 Baseten 和 Qwen（这家公司）提供的服务延迟约为 400ms，完全没法用。我把它降到了 70ms。这是从 finalize 到最终转录文本的时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
